---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Shield } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Practice | Institutional Charter">
  <div class="legal-page py-xxl bg-dark">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <div class="institutional-marker mb-md"><Shield size={14}/> Regulatory Compliance</div>
      <h1 class="text-white mb-xl">Terms of Clinical Practice</h1>
      
      <div class="prose text-text-muted">
        <p class="mb-lg">The clinical material provided on this platform is intended for institutional identification and protocol transparency. It does not constitute a final surgical directive.</p>
        
        <h3 class="text-white mt-xl mb-md">1. Clinical Governance</h3>
        <p class="mb-lg">All surgical procedures are governed by the Precision Orthopaedics Surgical Board and are subject to patient-specific anatomical suitability.</p>

        <h3 class="text-white mt-xl mb-md">2. Outcome Variance</h3>
        <p class="mb-lg">While robotic systems provide sub-millimeter precision, biological recovery rates vary according to individual patient factors and rehabilitation adherence.</p>

        <h3 class="text-white mt-xl mb-md">3. Academic Jurisdiction</h3>
        <p class="mb-lg">Precision Orthopaedics operates under the academic charter of its HOD-led leadership and UK-trained faculty, ensuring global standards are met locally.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page { min-height: 80vh; }
  .prose h3 { color: var(--white); }
  .prose p { line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
</style>
